				},
				{
					"id": 230240702,
					"content": "多亏了你的帮忙，这简直是我见过长势最好的蔷薇了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230240703
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瓦尔坦"
				},
				{
					"id": 230240703,
					"content": "「健康之家」的医生们应该也会惊叹吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230240704
					],
					"speakerTitle": "古尔根"
				},
				{
					"id": 230240704,
					"content": "事不宜迟，我这就去把这株花给移出来…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230240705
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瓦尔坦"
				},
				{
					"id": 230240705,
					"content": "等等，这是…什么动静？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230240706
					],
					"speakerTitle": "古尔根"
				},
				{
					"id": 230240706,
					"content": "花田中爆发出了异样的躁动…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230240707
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230240707,
					"content": "呜哇！是骗骗花！怎么会出现在这里？！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230240708
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 230240708,
					"content": "糟了！花田！它要把花田毁掉了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230240709,
						230240710
					],
					"speakerTitle": "古尔根"
				},
				{
					"id": 230240709,
					"content": "我来解决它！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230240711
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230240711,
					"content": "欸…欸？那只骗骗花…怎么逃跑了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230240712
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 230240712,
					"content": "怎么会…怎么会这样！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230240713
					],
					"speakerTitle": "古尔根"
				},
				{
					"id": 230240713,
					"content": "我们的蔷薇，最重要的草药…居然变成魔物逃走了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230240714,
						230240715
					],
					"speakerTitle": "古尔根"
				},
				{
					"id": 230240714,
					"content": "并不是「变成」…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230240716
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230240716,
					"content": "你的意思是…这株蔷薇之所以生长缓慢，就是因为这只骗骗花在捣乱？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230240717
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瓦尔坦"
				},
				{
					"id": 230240717,
					"content": "这么一说！完全没有作用的肥料…两倍的浇水量…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230240718
					],
					"speakerTitle": "古尔根"
				},
				{
					"id": 230240718,
					"content": "我，我们原来一直在照顾这只骗骗花吗？！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230240719
					],
					"speakerTitle": "古尔根"
				},
				{
					"id": 230240719,
					"content": "可恶…它到底是怎么混进花里面的，完全没发现啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230240720
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瓦尔坦"
				},
				{
					"id": 230240720,
					"content": "我们有时也会被骗。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230240721
					]
				},
